 "description": "Raising the IMU output data rate to 416 Hz puts the LSM6DS33 in high-performance mode, where it draws 1.25 mA. The electrical IMU node, which the IMU driver constrains, keeps the base current_draw of 0.9 mA (normal mode, 208 Hz) with no reason given, so the sensor's current understates its draw by 0.35 mA and disagrees with the 4.13 mW the control board now budgets for it.",
